# AutoDoc scaffolds the reference book and names what it generates _main.*,
# which the wildcards above already cover; its title page is generated too.
# The tutorial's main.xml and title.xml are written by hand -- note that its
# main.tex is not, hence the wildcard rather than /doc/tut/main.*.
/doc/ref/title.xml

